      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This change was made so the user has time to go to a mirror etc. whithout being stuck in a t-pose. This also makes it possible to interact with phiscal buttons you need to touch like mirrors etc. before you are calibrated. \nIf people really want the option back to start in a T-Pose, then it should be a launch option instead of undoing the change. I and a lot of others perfer the new way fo starting in a 3 point mode.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
