  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Prior to the IK 2.0 update, VRChat automatically entered FBT calibration mode when logging in (and the user had enough trackers).\nSince the update, you now have to always manually enter calibration mode via the menu. This is extremely cumbersome compared to before.\nPlease bring automatic calibration back, or at least add a toggle to the options, so it can be enabled on a per user basis.",
